{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39389","headline":"奉和左司郎中春物暗度感而成章 · 韦庄","name":"奉和左司郎中春物暗度感而成章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才喜新春已暮春，夕阳吟杀倚楼人。\n锦江风散霏霏雨，花市香飘漠漠尘。\n今日尚追巫峡梦，少年应遇洛川神。\n有时自患多情病，莫是生前宋玉身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}